WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.280
The booking calendar, by day and by week, for each staff member or room. Bookings the assistant takes in DMs land here automatically.

2
00:00:10.826 --> 00:00:14.950
Switch between Day and Week, and jump back with Today.

3
00:00:15.496 --> 00:00:22.960
To move a booking, drag and drop it. For a new one, double-click an empty spot, or click New booking.

4
00:00:23.511 --> 00:00:32.020
Click a booking to confirm it, mark it done, a no-show, or cancel it. The customer is told when it is moved or cancelled.
